  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Hello, developers.\nIn my environment, after the new update, when I launch VRC from the SteamVR menu, it crashes right after launch. This problem does not occur with other games, only with VRC. This problem crashes when I launch VRC from the SteamVR menu, but if I launch VRC from the desktop shortcut after launching SteamVR, it works fine without crashing.\nMy environment is as follows.\nALVR+SteamVR+VRC\nor\nOculus Link+SteamVR+VRC\nThe version of VRC is 2021.3.4 (Build ID:7352983).\nAlso, the same issue has been confirmed on Twitter.",
